<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39531" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικαθ-ίημι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>let down, set upon</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι βακτηρίᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ephipp.
					14.11
				</span></i>
			; <i>insert</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Heliod.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				44.23.53
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. <i>let
				down, shut</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πύλας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>Hann.</u>
					51
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>. <i>put
			down</i> the foot, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				60
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>.
			<i>incise</i> or <i>prick again</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				7.5.12
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
